VBDS v1.0 — licence scope
=========================

This repository does not carry a single licence. Different parts of it are covered by
different terms, and one part — the third-party imagery — is not licensed by the VBDS
authors at all.

1. CODE
-------
All source code in scripts/ and evaluation/ is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.
You may obtain a copy of that licence at:

    https://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

Unless required by applicable law or agreed to in writing, software distributed under that
licence is distributed on an "AS IS" BASIS, WITHOUT WARRANTIES OR CONDITIONS OF ANY KIND,
either express or implied.

2. ANNOTATIONS, SPLITS AND METADATA
-----------------------------------
The COCO annotation files (annotations/), split lists (splits/), taxonomy, metadata and
documentation produced by the VBDS authors are made available under the Creative Commons
Attribution-NonCommercial 4.0 International licence (CC BY-NC 4.0), to the extent the authors
hold rights in them:

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0/

Exceptions, where the terms of the underlying source prevail:

  - annotations for images from VisDrone (source unit S05) are additionally subject to
    CC BY-NC-SA 3.0 (share-alike);
  - annotations for images from TTPLA (source units S08, S09) are additionally subject to the
    Apache License 2.0;
  - annotations for images from sources whose terms are stricter than CC BY-NC 4.0 remain
    subject to those stricter terms.

No commercial use is granted over any annotation in this repository. See SOURCE_LICENSES.md.

3. IMAGES
---------
Images are not distributed through this repository. The image packages described in README §6
redistribute subsets of third-party imagery under the terms of their original sources, and are
governed by those terms, not by this file. The bundled NOTICE files restate the applicable
terms for each source unit. The VBDS authors grant no licence of their own over third-party
imagery.

Images from sources marked EXTERNAL_SOURCE, PERMISSION_REQUIRED, WEB_COLLECTED or WITHHELD in
metadata/source_manifest.csv are not distributed by this project in any form.

4. TRADEMARKS AND ATTRIBUTION
-----------------------------
Dataset names, publication titles and author names of the source datasets remain the property
of their respective holders and are used here only for attribution and identification.

If you use VBDS, cite the benchmark (CITATION.cff) and the original source datasets listed in
SOURCE_LICENSES.md.
